---
name: Parser adjudication unit
description: An adjudication unit written for the parser tests.
type: system
icon: flow.adjudicate
modification_date: 2026-01-15
version: 0.1.0
author: plan-marshall
---
# An adjudication unit written for the parser tests, not taken from any default unit.
# It covers decide ask and quorum lines between declare lines, and a role-each task state.
workflow adjudicate.decisions version 1 format 1
scope entity
declare max_rounds = 2
decide interpretation -> ask
decide approach -> quorum(architect, reviewer, 75)
decide scope -> quorum(architect, 60)
declare panel = [Lead, second]
start adjudicate.vote

state adjudicate.vote
    job llm decision role each adjudicate.list-roles
        decided -> adjudicate.settled
        lost -> adjudicate.settled

state adjudicate.settled terminal settled success
